#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0255 expect=noViolation domain=TI
# Rule:Description: Trigger error when TIVERS is present and IETESTCD is not unique within TIVERS
#note "TIVERS present; IETESTCD is unique within each TIVERS value (Positive control added by PLAN-absent-guard-test-hardening P3: CDISC-CG0255 previously had ONLY an expect=skipped fixture, which asserts non-execution and so proved nothing about the rule ever running. Modelled on its twin CORE-000145.)"
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TI label="Trial Inclusion/ Exclusion Criteria"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col IETESTCD type=Char label="Incl/Excl Criterion Short Name" format=$IETESTCD.
col IETEST type=Char label="Inclusion/Exclusion Criterion" format=$IETEST.
col TIVERS type=Char label="IE Version"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TI | EXCL09 | Previously completed or withdrawn from this study | V1
CDISCPILOT01 | TI | EXCL10 | Use of any investigational agent within 30 days | V1
---
